qRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"d9OTctJEITa5DmAvWpKfoA","review_id":"YBGVHjeZuDZa6BelgpzYTQ","date":"2015-02-16T13:45:46","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9397671222686768,"text_excerpt":"I honestly have nothing bad to say about this place. My friend and I went last week and throughly enjoyed it. It's set up like a Theo's; order at the counter, get a sign with a face on it and they will bring you your delicious pasta dish. We were unaware they had obtained their liquor license so we had brought a bottle of wine, and they were really cool about letting us drink our bottle since we didn't know. I had the shrimp piccata which was so good, I ate every bit. My friend ordered the spicy meatball (I think it was a special?) and she raved about it. We went on a weekday, so it wasn't too crowded and the atmosphere was very nice. The service was great, too. I will definitely be retur..."},{"business_id":"d9OTctJEITa5DmAvWpKfoA","review_id":"2ejL_sk5vIRAhViHVjYT6Q","date":"2015-06-29T21:49:09","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9356696605682373,"text_excerpt":"This place amazed me! I love the simple \"build your own\" pasta. Good wine selection here. I got the spicy tomato cream over the black pepper fettuccni. I added chicken and it was really spicy, but very delicious. My wife got the pomodoro sauce over rigatoni and I urged her to add the meatballs. Those meatballs were fantastic! By far the best thing we had ordered. I will definitely come back here and try all of the combinations! (ok not all, but most)"},{"business_id":"d9OTctJEITa5DmAvWpKfoA","review_id":"Blng_FnLrRBjXQb3jqAsAw","date":"2014-06-22T14:06:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.929115891456604,"text_excerpt":"I love that Arabella has come to my neighborhood! They are always so friendly, and not in that gross TGIFriday's way. Everytime I go in I make a new friend at the counter and then I'm like \"Oh yeah, I need to order something.\" Ordering is fun! As the staff will tell you, there are thousands of possible combinations. You choose the noodle, the sauce, and any add-ons you might need. Meatballs, skrimps, other things... Can't remember. Everything is made with love in house, even the noodles! I like the cork screws, which I believe are sometimes gluten free. Last time I went I got the Marco Pollo sauce, which had tomatoes, artichokes, and chicken in a creamy white sauce. I also had the seasona..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"d9OTctJEITa5DmAvWpKfoA","photo_id":"tfNod4H6RxodWyI4j2rjoQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/tfNod4H6RxodWyI4j2rjoQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9098047614097595},{"business_id":"d9OTctJEITa5DmAvWpKfoA","photo_id":"1lzoi2xO2pHYorkLie1uyQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1lzoi2xO2pHYorkLie1uyQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8301376104354858},{"business_id":"d9OTctJEITa5DmAvWpKfoA","photo_id":"FeLI4w7NjZUtMqVq_gnXGg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/FeLI4w7NjZUtMqVq_gnXGg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7862637639045715}]},"notebook_case":null}
